    "enUS": {
      "description": "If you're headed into Shaper's Terrace, I would ask a favor of you.\r\n\r\nThere are reports of slimes that live in the pools by the colorless Achromatic Crystal. I believe their essence could be of use in my experiments, and would like you to bring me some samples for study.\r\n\r\nI will make it worth your while.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Seeping Slime Essence",
          "type": "item"
